      "message": "Once again, there is no information available to fix this, so just need to hack this in. Fortunately, this one was fixed in U and so this hack might eventually be removed. Without this hack on Android T and earlier any request for Roboto will be unable to find the 400 (normal) weight.\n\nWith the old font manager there never was a font named Roboto (it was named \"sans-serif\" by the fonts.xml) so this was never a problem. With this new font manager there are now fonts named Roboto (since we weren\u0027t given the names we must use whatever names the font has inside).",
